  {
   "tipo": "explicacion",
   "titulo": "Before the name",
   "texto": [
    "Before the name we use the short forms: **acest tricou** («esta camiseta»), **această bluză**, **acești pantofi**, **aceste rochii**. The name goes without the defined article. **Tricou** is neutral: the demonstrative is masculine in singular (**acest tricou**) and feminine in plural (**aceste tricouri**)."
   ]
  },
  {
   "tipo": "explicacion",
   "titulo": "«Este» or «That»",
   "texto": [
    "**Acest, această, acești, aceste** indicate closeness; **acel, acea, acei, acele**, distance. If the demonstrative replaces the name, the complete form is used: **acesta** («este»), **aceasta** («This»), **aceștia** («these»), **acestea** («You are.»)."
   ]
  },
